_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":88,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o016a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-91a1c767b310bb1e937f","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年，刘备率大众来向西界。权命逊为大都督，假节，督朱然、潘璋、宋谦、韩当、徐盛、鲜于丹、孙桓等五万人拒之〖5〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o016","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-91a1c767b310bb1e937f","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年，刘备率大众来向西界。权命逊为大都督，假节，督朱然、潘璋、宋谦、韩当、徐盛、鲜于丹、孙桓等五万人拒之〖5〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o027","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-6b23f8730a9cef243526","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮与正，虽好尚不同〖31〗，以公义相取〖32〗；亮每奇正智术。先主既即尊号，将东征孙权以复关羽之耻，群臣多谏，一不从。章武二年，大军败绩，还住白帝。亮叹曰：“法孝直若在，则能制主上，令不东行；就复东行，必不倾危矣！”﹝四﹞","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o027a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-1c7d099f67169d9f1682","layer":"original","quote":"权大怒，乃遣吕蒙督鲜于丹、徐忠、孙规等兵二万，取长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡；使鲁肃以万人屯巴丘〖6〗，﹝一﹞以御关羽；权住陆口，为诸军节度〖7〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o027","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-1c7d099f67169d9f1682","layer":"original","quote":"权大怒，乃遣吕蒙督鲜于丹、徐忠、孙规等兵二万，取长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡；使鲁肃以万人屯巴丘〖6〗，﹝一﹞以御关羽；权住陆口，为诸军节度〖7〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o054","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7e0fdf82962252602cbd","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年春正月〖1〗，陆逊部将军宋谦等〖2〗，攻蜀五屯；皆破之，斩其将。三月，鄱阳言黄龙现〖3〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o044b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-fcd99756379fb59ed6f5","layer":"original","quote":"乃遣吕蒙袭夺长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡〖3〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-e74ba7effc86126dc3fe","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-e74ba7effc86126dc3fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5302047b97c4e4d2cb00","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o044","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-fcd99756379fb59ed6f5","layer":"original","quote":"二十年〖1〗，孙权以先主已得益州，使使报“欲得荆州〖2〗”。先主言：“须得凉州，当以荆州相与。”权忿之，乃遣吕蒙袭夺长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡〖3〗。先主引兵五万下公安，令关羽入益阳〖4〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o058a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-20eaf3786f782c63ee9e","layer":"original","quote":"备既定益州，权求长沙、零、桂；备不承旨〖8〗，权遣吕蒙率众进取。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o081a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-82ba5f92bc12b49d8842","layer":"original","quote":"是时刘备令关羽镇守，专有荆土。权命蒙西取长沙、零、桂三郡。蒙移书二郡，望风归服；惟零陵太守郝普〖1〗，城守不降。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":380,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-12e561ec2dd3b0556c79","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-5bf4e7d96e33d95524a0","layer":"original","quote":"奂以地主〖3〗，使所部将军鲜于丹，帅五千人先断淮道〖4〗；自帅吴硕、张梁五千人，为军前锋：降高城〖5〗，得三将","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
